# Identity consolidation.
#
# CLAUDE.md makes this repository's authorship a standing rule: commits are
# authored and committed as yashita-thakur-2 <yashitathakur6yt@gmail.com>,
# because the commit history is part of the provenance chain that CITATION.cff
# and DATA_LICENSE.md point at.
#
# One commit -- fc8346a, a one-character edit to the README title -- was made
# through the GitHub web editor, which recorded a different address for the same
# author. It was already published when that was noticed, so it is mapped here
# rather than rewritten: git log, git shortlog and git blame all report the
# canonical identity, and no published history is discarded to achieve it.
#
# The COMMITTER on that commit remains GitHub <noreply@github.com>, and is
# deliberately not mapped. A .mailmap is for consolidating alternate addresses
# of the same person; noreply@github.com is a web interface, not this author,
# and mapping it would assert something untrue about who made the commit.

yashita-thakur-2 <yashitathakur6yt@gmail.com> <yashitathakur.contact@gmail.com>
